{"vid":"bX_0Kievvsg","source":"bX_0Kievvsg.en-GB.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":1.3,"txt":"(♪♪♪)"},{"t":8.3,"txt":"Do you like physically demanding work"},{"t":10.2,"txt":"that's done in a careful, precise way?"},{"t":12.6,"txt":"Do you have an analytical mind and enjoy working with"},{"t":15,"txt":"very little direct supervision?"},{"t":16.9,"txt":"And are you comfortable working high up?"},{"t":19.3,"txt":"If you answered yes to these questions,"},{"t":21.6,"txt":"you might be a perfect fit for a career as"},{"t":23.6,"txt":"a steamfitter / pipefitter."},{"t":26,"txt":"Steamfitter / pipefitters follow specifications"},{"t":28.7,"txt":"to lay out materials for piping systems"},{"t":31.1,"txt":"and carry out their installation."},{"t":33.2,"txt":"They also test, maintain and repair existing systems."},{"t":36.2,"txt":"This occupation requires technical skill,"},{"t":38.4,"txt":"good physical strength and stamina."},{"t":41.1,"txt":"To find out what's in the pipeline for this career,"},{"t":43.3,"txt":"we spoke to a steamfitter / pipefitter."},{"t":46.2,"txt":"(♪♪♪)"},{"t":54.5,"txt":"My name is Desmond."},{"t":55.3,"txt":"I am a steamfitter / pipefitter."},{"t":57.5,"txt":"(♪♪♪)"},{"t":63,"txt":"A steamfitter / pipefitter"},{"t":65,"txt":"lays out, assembles, fabricates, maintains"},{"t":68.3,"txt":"and repairs piping systems."},{"t":69.7,"txt":"(grinding)"},{"t":72.9,"txt":"I work in a fabrication shop,"},{"t":74.7,"txt":"but steamfitting / pipefitting can take you to various places."},{"t":78.3,"txt":"So, around the city we have fabrication shops,"},{"t":80.3,"txt":"like where I am."},{"t":81.6,"txt":"Also, there's various plants around the city,"},{"t":84.3,"txt":"and each of these plants have piping systems."},{"t":86.8,"txt":"These piping systems are taken care of"},{"t":88.7,"txt":"by steamfitter / pipefitters."},{"t":91.3,"txt":"(pop)"},{"t":92.9,"txt":"At my table, I fabricate the spools,"},{"t":95.9,"txt":"so you'll see me fitting pipe up to flanges,"},{"t":98.6,"txt":"elbows, valves, etcetera,"},{"t":100.7,"txt":"preparing the spool for the welder."},{"t":104.1,"txt":"You'll have the hydro crew, they'll test the pipe"},{"t":106.4,"txt":"to see if all the welds and everything is up to code,"},{"t":110.3,"txt":"and to pressurize it,"},{"t":112.3,"txt":"make sure it doesn't leak or fail"},{"t":114.1,"txt":"while it's in operation when it gets moved up to site."},{"t":118.5,"txt":"I like everything about pipefitting."},{"t":120.5,"txt":"It's just so meticulous."},{"t":122.9,"txt":"I like the welding aspect of it,"},{"t":124.8,"txt":"the cutting of it with the oxy acetylene torch,"},{"t":128,"txt":"I love grinding..."},{"t":129.2,"txt":"(grinding)"},{"t":131.9,"txt":"And I like looking at what I've built"},{"t":133.7,"txt":"and knowing that I've built that."},{"t":136.2,"txt":"The foreman gave us this new job."},{"t":138.5,"txt":"I think the skills required"},{"t":139.5,"txt":"to be a steamfitter / pipefitter are vast."},{"t":143.2,"txt":"You need great communication skills"},{"t":145.5,"txt":"just simply for the fact that"},{"t":146.9,"txt":"we work in a dangerous environment."},{"t":150.8,"txt":"We need strong math skills because we're constantly"},{"t":154.2,"txt":"adding, subtracting, using trigonometry,"},{"t":156.6,"txt":"adding the weights of various pipes and spools for lifting,"},{"t":160.2,"txt":"and calculating them all together."},{"t":163,"txt":"We have to be capable of reading and understanding"},{"t":165.2,"txt":"these blueprints,"},{"t":167,"txt":"so then we can plan the job ahead of us."},{"t":169.5,"txt":"(♪♪♪)"},{"t":175.8,"txt":"There is a big possibility of working at heights."},{"t":178.1,"txt":"We have a mod yard here,"},{"t":179.3,"txt":"and these mods can get anywhere up to 40 feet high,"},{"t":182.9,"txt":"so you're climbing ladders all day,"},{"t":184.9,"txt":"up and down."},{"t":185.9,"txt":"(grinding)"},{"t":189.5,"txt":"For a steamfitter / pipefitter there are tons and tons"},{"t":192.2,"txt":"of opportunities"},{"t":193.3,"txt":"and advancement available for us."},{"t":195.9,"txt":"Opportunities for advancement, being a pipefitter, are huge."},{"t":199.9,"txt":"You can move up to be a foreman,"},{"t":201.4,"txt":"the general foreman, superintendent,"},{"t":203.1,"txt":"and then possibly even higher in your companies."},{"t":207.4,"txt":"What we're looking for in a steamfitter / pipefitter"},{"t":209.5,"txt":"is someone who pays attention to detail,"},{"t":211.8,"txt":"not afraid to get dirty,"},{"t":213.6,"txt":"but at the same time, a quick learner."},{"t":215.1,"txt":"Today it's pretty cold out there."},{"t":216.3,"txt":"Watch your footing in the craneways,"},{"t":217.8,"txt":"it is icy out there."},{"t":219.3,"txt":"The people who want to pursue pipefitting occupation,"},{"t":221.9,"txt":"I'd say it is an awesome trade to get into."},{"t":224.5,"txt":"If you're willing to put in the hard work,"},{"t":226.7,"txt":"you get a lot of reward out of it."},{"t":228.8,"txt":"(grinding)"},{"t":231.6,"txt":"I believe being an Aboriginal pipefitter,"},{"t":234.5,"txt":"it just allows my people to know that there are"},{"t":237.7,"txt":"plenty of opportunities out there for us."},{"t":240.4,"txt":"Within my family,"},{"t":241.4,"txt":"I am the first steamfitter / pipefitter,"},{"t":243.8,"txt":"and I am extremely proud of myself."},{"t":248.1,"txt":"In the near future, I see myself as a foreman,"},{"t":251.5,"txt":"maybe a general foreman."},{"t":252.9,"txt":"It's all up to me and what I'm willing to do,"},{"t":254.9,"txt":"and the future looks bright."},{"t":258,"txt":"Being a steamfitter / pipefitter"},{"t":259.5,"txt":"requires a combination of good physical health,"},{"t":262.6,"txt":"manual dexterity and a mind for detail,"},{"t":265.6,"txt":"and you'll definitely need to be comfortable"},{"t":267.3,"txt":"working in high places."},{"t":269.6,"txt":"Discover more about this occupation,"},{"t":271.6,"txt":"such as education requirements and salary ranges"},{"t":274.7,"txt":"in the occupational profile on the ALIS website,"},{"t":277.9,"txt":"and learn about related occupations"},{"t":279.7,"txt":"like refrigeration and air conditioning mechanic"},{"t":281.8,"txt":"and sprinkler systems installer."},{"t":285,"txt":"Go to alis.alberta.ca"},{"t":287,"txt":"and make the most of your future."},{"t":289,"txt":"(♪♪♪)"}],"words":[{"t":1.333,"w":"(♪♪♪)"},{"t":8.274,"w":"Do"},{"t":8.274,"w":"you"},{"t":8.274,"w":"like"},{"t":8.274,"w":"physically"},{"t":8.274,"w":"demanding"},{"t":8.274,"w":"work"},{"t":10.242,"w":"that's"},{"t":10.242,"w":"done"},{"t":10.242,"w":"in"},{"t":10.242,"w":"a"},{"t":10.242,"w":"careful,"},{"t":10.242,"w":"precise"},{"t":10.242,"w":"way?"},{"t":12.611,"w":"Do"},{"t":12.611,"w":"you"},{"t":12.611,"w":"have"},{"t":12.611,"w":"an"},{"t":12.611,"w":"analytical"},{"t":12.611,"w":"mind"},{"t":12.611,"w":"and"},{"t":12.611,"w":"enjoy"},{"t":12.611,"w":"working"},{"t":12.611,"w":"with"},{"t":15.014,"w":"very"},{"t":15.014,"w":"little"},{"t":15.014,"w":"direct"},{"t":15.014,"w":"supervision?"},{"t":16.882,"w":"And"},{"t":16.882,"w":"are"},{"t":16.882,"w":"you"},{"t":16.882,"w":"comfortable"},{"t":16.882,"w":"working"},{"t":16.882,"w":"high"},{"t":16.882,"w":"up?"},{"t":19.285,"w":"If"},{"t":19.285,"w":"you"},{"t":19.285,"w":"answered"},{"t":19.285,"w":"yes"},{"t":19.285,"w":"to"},{"t":19.285,"w":"these"},{"t":19.285,"w":"questions,"},{"t":21.62,"w":"you"},{"t":21.62,"w":"might"},{"t":21.62,"w":"be"},{"t":21.62,"w":"a"},{"t":21.62,"w":"perfect"},{"t":21.62,"w":"fit"},{"t":21.62,"w":"for"},{"t":21.62,"w":"a"},{"t":21.62,"w":"career"},{"t":21.62,"w":"as"},{"t":23.589,"w":"a"},{"t":23.589,"w":"steamfitter"},{"t":23.589,"w":"/"},{"t":23.589,"w":"pipefitter."},{"t":26.025,"w":"Steamfitter"},{"t":26.025,"w":"/"},{"t":26.025,"w":"pipefitters"},{"t":26.025,"w":"follow"},{"t":26.025,"w":"specifications"},{"t":28.727,"w":"to"},{"t":28.727,"w":"lay"},{"t":28.727,"w":"out"},{"t":28.727,"w":"materials"},{"t":28.727,"w":"f